notes:
I found three real options for preschoolers in Oakville this fall. None of the pages I read posted a fall day or time, so I left `when` out wherever a page didn't give one.

```json
{
  "picks": [
    {
      "name": "Learn to Swim Preschool A–E, Town of Oakville",
      "age_fit": "Preschool levels A, B, C, D, E, 3 - 5 years",
      "when": "Fall registration opened Tuesday, August 11 at 7 a.m. The class days and times are on the Town's registration site, which asks for a login.",
      "source_name": "Town of Oakville"
    },
    {
      "name": "YMCA Preschool Swim Lessons, YMCA of Oakville",
      "age_fit": "3-5 years",
      "when": "Runs in 12-week sessions with a one-week break between them. Registration is required each session for members and non-members. I did not find fall class days or times.",
      "source_name": "YMCA of Oakville"
    },
    {
      "name": "Junior (Beginner - Intermediate) group swim lessons, Goldfish Swim School - Oakville",
      "age_fit": "3-4 Years",
      "price": "Group lessons $32.50 per lesson, 30-minute classes, plus a $30 annual membership fee. Lessons are billed monthly.",
      "source_name": "Goldfish Swim School"
    }
  ]
}
```

- **Town of Oakville:** The Town's own page says children must be the age required for the level by the program start date. The "3 - 5 years" age range for Preschool A–E comes from a copy of the Town's aquatics brochure on a third-party site. I did not find it on oakville.ca itself, and I found no price for these classes.
- **YMCA of Oakville:** The YMCA page gives no price or fall start date in what I read. The Peter Gilgan Family YMCA location I saw was listed for the parent-and-tot class, not the preschool class, so I did not attach a location to this pick.
- **Goldfish Swim School:** I did not find a fall schedule or a day and time for the Junior class.
